{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Opaque"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"There is no cryptography in this enum, or anywhere in this package. That is deliberate and is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what §23.1 requires: OPAQUE needs an oblivious PRF, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hash_to_curve"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"expand_message_xmd"},{"type":"text","text":", an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"envelope construction and a three-message AKE, and eleven independent implementations of that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is eleven chances to be subtly and silently wrong. The SRP-6a this replaces was arithmetic"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every language can express — which here meant a hand-written big-integer modular exponentiation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pbkdf2_sha256"},{"type":"text","text":"-only limitation on top, because Swift has no Argon2 that ships on every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"supported platform."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/opaque"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Opaque","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Enumeration","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK6OpaqueO","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Opaque"}],"symbolKind":"enum","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":